<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0201_01_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえねえ　あなた
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　って　ポケモン　もってる？▼
よかったら　あたしの　[Name:PokemonName Idx="1" ]と
あなたの　[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　こうかん　しよ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえねえ　あなた
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　って　ポケモン　もってる？▼
よかったら　あたしの　[Name:PokemonName Idx="1" ]と
あなたの　[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　交換しよ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ポケモン交換前
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい→ポケモン選択画面
　いいえ→woman2_04
・0＝渡すポケモン
・1＝もらうポケモン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0201_01_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うわー　ありがとう！
では　こうかん　しましょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うわー　ありがとう！
では　交換しましょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・はい選択
　ポケモン選択画面で条件を満たすポケモンを選択
　メッセージ表示後に交換デモ開始</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0201_01_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うふふ！　あたしの
[Name:PokemonName Idx="1" ]　だいじにしてね！▼
あたしも　もらった
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　だいじに　するから！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うふふ！　あたしの
[Name:PokemonName Idx="1" ]　大事にしてね！▼
あたしも　もらった
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　大事にするから！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・交換デモ終了後、以下のメッセージを自動表示
・0＝渡すポケモン
・1＝もらうポケモン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0201_01_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしが　こうかん　してほしいのは
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　なんだけど……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしが　交換してほしいのは
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]　なんだけど……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ポケモン交換
・0＝渡すポケモン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
