				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　おかげで
あたしと　あなた▽
お友達に　なれたよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T05:29:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
